<p id="A3.SS1.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A3.SS1.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{U}_{\mathsf{P}\mathsf{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖴</mi><mi>𝖯𝖯</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{U}_{\mathsf{P}\mathsf{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> is self-adjoint, this proves</span></p>